## Pricing

- [Pricing Plans](https://wpastra.com/pricing/): Three "+ AI" plans combine the WordPress toolkit with an integrated AI platform (AI site generation, premium AI designs, included hosted websites, and a free domain for 1 year). Astra Pro + AI: $99 first year (renews at $149/year) or $279 lifetime — Astra Pro for up to 3 websites plus AI site generation and 1 hosted website. Essential Toolkit + AI: $199 first year (renews at $299/year) or $549 lifetime — up to 10 websites, adds Spectra Pro, premium Starter Templates, Ultimate Elementor Addons, 5 blueprint and 5 sandbox sites, and 2 hosted websites. Business Toolkit + AI: $279 first year (renews at $429/year) or $799 lifetime — up to 1000 websites, adds SureForms Agency, the AI Site Planner, 20 blueprint and 20 sandbox sites, 24/7 VIP support, and 5 hosted websites. A standalone Astra Pro addon-only license (no AI bundle) is also available at $69/year or $249 one-time for up to 3 websites. Lifetime plans include the AI platform and hosted websites for 3 years. All plans include a 14-day money-back guarantee; introductory prices renew at full price.
